1
00:00:06,966 --> 00:00:07,766
Cheng Ze

2
00:00:08,433 --> 00:00:10,900
You said it yourself

3
00:00:13,766 --> 00:00:14,833
Business partnerships naturally

4
00:00:14,833 --> 00:00:16,066
require practical considerations

5
00:00:19,866 --> 00:00:21,233
So you admit it

6
00:00:21,366 --> 00:00:23,966
You admit choosing Su Yurou

7
00:00:23,966 --> 00:00:25,766
was for her key authorization

8
00:00:25,833 --> 00:00:26,833
I didn't say that

9
00:00:27,233 --> 00:00:28,633
Then what exactly did you say

10
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:30,729
Sis

11
00:00:30,729 --> 00:00:32,700
I admit I like Cheng Ze

12
00:00:32,766 --> 00:00:35,000
But who can control their feelings

13
00:00:35,233 --> 00:00:36,633
Liking someone isn't wrong

14
00:00:36,666 --> 00:00:38,066
But wearing someone else's wedding ring

15
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:39,266
standing at their wedding

16
00:00:39,266 --> 00:00:40,366
and claiming you're innocent

17
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:41,300
is just not right

18
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:43,000
If she didn't really want it

19
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:44,033
why didn't she take it off earlier

20
00:00:44,266 --> 00:00:45,600
Crying now won't do any good

21
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:47,033
I can give the ring back

22
00:00:47,033 --> 00:00:48,500
I really don't want to make you sad

23
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:49,300
No need

24
00:00:50,166 --> 00:00:51,166
The ring isn't the point

25
00:00:51,766 --> 00:00:53,766
The point is why he chose you

26
00:00:53,766 --> 00:00:54,900
which has already been made clear

27
00:00:56,266 --> 00:00:57,266
Calmer than earlier

28
00:00:57,600 --> 00:00:58,666
I wasn't calm enough just now

29
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:00,000
I wanted to tear the place apart earlier
